    "turn_idx": 0,
    "turn_text": "JB Pritzker now live with this as well, also celebrating this bicentennial day. Governor like Pritzker are you there? Jim, how are you doing? Very well. Likewise. Thank you. Before we get into discussion about the bicentennial, I wanted to get your thoughts as well. I know you've had some comments on the situation here in Taylorville and other parts of the state so badly hit by the tornadoes on Saturday night. I know you've talked about what's been happening down there for the first responders and others. What are your thoughts today as this cleanup is continuing?",
