    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Well obviously our thoughts and prayers are with the people of Taylorville and Stonington and other places that have been hit by this and you know I reached out to the mayors of both places to offer them any help that I could be. I want to make sure that they know that when I take office on January 14th that I'm going to continue the work that the IEMA and other agencies have been doing for them and make sure that we're restoring everything that we can for the families that have lost so much.",
