        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Effective resource allocation is essential during emergencies.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Inter-agency coordination is necessary for successful emergency response.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Preparation is possible and valuable even for overwhelming responsibilities.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener values accountability and performance in their role.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Crisis preparedness requires more than just technical skills—it demands emotional readiness.",
        "confidence": 0.85
