  {
    "episode_id": 78475,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/8/78475.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "You have announced a number of different committees to look at various aspects of state operations as you prepare to take office. These are big committees. We've seen downstate representation, a lot of people on there, a lot of different subject areas. How do you possibly hope to gather and synthesize all that information in the few short weeks before you take the oath of office?",
